Patch Description:
- Bugs in dialogs (English Version) were fixed;
- You may now use pretzels while riding wild goose in garden location;
- Ghosts in Level 9 Temple Location are now fixed;
- Boss Cardinal grappling attack is now fixed;

We are glad you to report us on our bugs and are ready to fix it as soon as possible. Thanks for your feedback!

